it seems we don't have luck w building Jenkins controller - I did some more googling and u might want to try these:
generate a fully resolved, flattened plugins.txt: 
Plain Text
java -jar jpm.jar --jenkins-version <YOUR_VERSION> -d ref/plugins -f plugins.txt --no-download --available-updates -o txt > resolved_plugins.txt
 
Execute the download using the new list: 
Plain Text
java -jar jpm.jar --jenkins-version <YOUR_VERSION> -d /var/lib/jenkins/plugins -f resolved_plugins.txt
 
